<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's forex market shut for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's forex market shut for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed for a public holiday on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Bangladesh taka finished unchanged at 42.5495/5500 to the dollar in interbank trading on Wednesday. The market will reopen on Saturday after the Moslem Friday weekend.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
